{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:31:21+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "This is a Ghost", "steam_appid": 1985420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>This is a Ghost</strong> pushes ghost hunting further by combining paranormal investigation with strategic banishment mechanics. Explore haunted locations, select your equipment carefully, and face the unknown alone or as a team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're a <strong>ghost hunter</strong>!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the entity among <strong>23 types[/p].[/p][/*]<br></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>8 evidence types[/p].[/p][/*]<br></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal its behavior: vengeful, residual, or lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap and banish the entity from <strong>69 possibilities[/p][/*]<br></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 maps</strong> with different atmospheres and sizes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels and an optional challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or in co-op for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities and behaviors have unique abilities:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon</strong>: possesses a player for a few seconds by attracting them or using their weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banshee</strong>: screams and immobilizes its victim before attacking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siren</strong>: sings and drains life and energy from nearby players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more</p></li></ul></p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985420/extras/ee1b79d1743dca34252c5f866fcd4886.poster.avif?t=1785314177\" width=